# Redirects for Cloudflare Pages (collegesafetydata.org); vercel.json
# "redirects" has the same rules for Vercel (collegesafetydata.com).
#
# Old addresses that are still linked. Cloudflare keeps the request's query
# string when the destination has none (/rankings?year=2023 -> /?year=2023)
# and matches a path exactly, so the trailing-slash form has its own line.
# The Pages worker (dist/_worker.js) handles only /school/* (dist/_routes.json),
# so these paths are served by Pages itself, which applies this file.

/rankings          /             301
/rankings/         /             301
/data/audit.json   /audit.json   301
